title Vinyl: Now playing's transition chip shows the Transition setting (owner, 2026-11-20): Crossfade 20 sec gives "Crossfade 20 s", after it the playing track's ReplayGain as before ("Crossfade 20 s, RG -3.2 dB"), the widest text the chip gets on the square and large classes; Normal hides the chip (qa-transition-chip-normal), 640x480: qa-transition-chip-640, 480x320 and 320x480: qa-transition-chip-small
sizes 800x480 480x480 720x720 1280x720
env VINYL_DEMO 1
env VINYL_DEMO_STATE playing
env VINYL_DEMO_TRANSITION crossfade_20

wait 1200
shot 01-now-crossfade-20
expect text "Crossfade 20 s, RG -3.2 dB"
expect notext "Gapless"
expect noquit
